WEBVTT

00:09:27.196 --> 00:09:30.836
anger, despair,

00:09:30.876 --> 00:09:34.556
we have a chance to accompany it,

00:09:34.596 --> 00:09:36.636
to be with it

00:09:36.636 --> 00:09:41.516
and to look deeply
into what it is telling us.

00:09:42.716 --> 00:09:47.796
Our suffering contains within it
the suffering of our world.

00:09:48.676 --> 00:09:51.556
The violence, the destruction,

00:09:51.596 --> 00:09:54.796
the discrimination and exploitation

00:09:54.836 --> 00:09:58.796
that is going on right now
across our planet.